    "created_at": "2016-09-12T21:33:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-12T21:33:24Z",
    "body": "I understand this problem a bit better now, a few hours later. The problem was that both the multipage-html and multipage-dev versions were writing to ../link-fixup.js, so multipage-dev (which has fewer fragment links) was overwriting the link-fixup.js with its version.\n\nThe fix requires updating your Wattsi and html-build. Now wattsi puts link-fixup.js inside the multipage-{dev,html} folders, and html-build copies the one from multipage-html into the root.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
